WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.560
Conan here, reminding you all

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.530
to check out our new
Esports show "Wreck League,"

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:05.900
where we force professional gamers

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.370
to compete in video games
that are quite absurd.

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:12.700
Hosted by comedians Orlando
Leyba and Forrest Shaw,

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.330
this week's episode pits pro gamers,

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:20.330
MissesMae and StoneMountain64,
you can tell I'm a fan,

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.270
against each other in the brutal

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:25.740
and unforgiving world of "Goat Simulator."

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.130
That's right, we're forcing
these two pro gamers

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.800
to see who can be better

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.663
at controlling a fake video game goat.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.930
Anyway, I think we
finally reached the peak

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.140
of sports entertainment.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.910
"Wreck League" airs this
Friday night at midnight

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.250
as part of the TBS show "Super Punch."

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.020
Can't wait to see how many cars get licked

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:50.360
by a simulated goat.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:51.193
Check it out.

00:00:51.193 --> 00:00:52.080
Round two,
(intense music)

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.970
find Conan O'Brien and headbutt him.

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:58.010
The first one of you to do
that will win round two.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:01.870
Where would Conan be?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.870
I think that I'm within the
vicinity of Sir Conan here.

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:08.480
Conan, where are you at?
Where are you at, my guy?

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:11.060
Oh wait. What the, oh!
(goat screeching)

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.640
This studio is mine. You
gotta bring me on the show.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.923
I won't make this big of a mess,

00:01:15.923 --> 00:01:19.533
but no promises either.

00:01:20.504 --> 00:01:23.254
(crowd cheering)

